# Evolution: Proposals

Spec: ProposalsIndex
Purpose:
  Registry of architecture, skill, and concept proposals under review.
  Proposals are the formal mechanism for introducing new system knowledge.

Owns: evolution/proposals/

Structure:
  Proposals are .sdd files with @proposal.AXX IDs.
  Status field: proposed | under-review | approved | rejected

ProposalRecord:
  @proposal.A22
  observed: domain isolation pattern
  existing: @architecture.layered
  gap: domain rules leaking into application layer
  candidate: domain-oriented architecture
  evidence: T100, T133, T178

Rules:
  [PROP-01] Proposals MUST include observed evidence and candidate solution.
  [PROP-02] Proposals MUST identify existing concepts they extend or supersede.
  [PROP-03] Approved proposals move to @../approved/.

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  Discovery: @../discovery.sdd
  Candidates: @../candidates/INDEX.sdd
  Approved: @../approved/INDEX.sdd
  EvolutionPolicy: @../../policies/evolution.sdd

State: +
